<title>FRANCE: Axa confirms sold Schneider shares.</title>
<headline>Axa confirms sold Schneider shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance group Axa-UAP confirmed on Thursday it had sold at least 2.3 million shares in Schneider SA on Wednesday and Thursday.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman did not confirm the price of the deal, which market sources put at 320 francs per share.</p>
</text>
